    "productType": "DAYTOUR",
    "name": "Great Ocean Road Tour and VIP Wildlife Experience",
    "shortDescription": "Connect Aussie Tours. Over 500,000 visitors per year visit The Great Ocean Road, Australia. Great value quality tours at the best possible price. We don't just show you the sights – we guarantee you a selfie with a koala!",
    "description": "<h4><p><b>Stop 1: Guaranteed Australian Wildlife Encounter – Only with Us -&nbsp;</b>中文版本在英文下方</p><p>Your day begins with something no other Great Ocean Road tour can offer — a guaranteed, hands-on encounter with real Australian wildlife, including koalas you can pat and photograph under licensed supervision.</p><p>While other tours promise “wildlife spotting,” we guarantee it. No hoping for distant glimpses — this is a genuine, up-close experience in a private, weather-safe indoor venue at Akuna Anglesea, hosted by WildlifeXposure’s licensed wildlife educators.</p><br><p>You’ll meet:</p><ul><li><p>Koalas – touch and take photos (supervised)</p></li><li><p>Snakes, crocodiles, and native birds</p></li><li><p>Possums, gliders, dragons and lizards</p></li></ul><p>This unforgettable VIP session includes morning tea at Akuna’s award-winning restaurant — coffee, pastries, paninis, and fresh juice — before we hit the road.</p><br><p><b>Stop 2: Great Ocean Road Memorial Arch</b></p><br><p>Next, we visit the famous Memorial Arch, the historic gateway built by returned WWI servicemen — the world’s largest war memorial. It’s a perfect photo stop and the true start of your coastal adventure.</p><br><p><b>Stop 3: Apollo Bay – Seaside Lunch</b></p><br><p>Relax in Apollo Bay, a charming coastal village where the Otways meet the sea. Enjoy free time for lunch, beach walks, or local shopping before continuing west.</p><br><p><b>Stop 4: The Twelve Apostles – Coastal Icons</b></p><br><p>We finish at the breathtaking Twelve Apostles, Victoria’s most photographed natural wonder. Walk the viewing boardwalks and capture unforgettable photos of the rugged cliffs and ocean stacks.</p><br><p>Return Journey</p><br><p>The return trip winds inland through the Otway forest and countryside, offering a peaceful end to your full-day adventure.</p><br><p>No other tour gives you this — a guaranteed hands-on koala encounter, plus the best of the Great Ocean Road, all in one day.</p></h4><p>&nbsp;<b>INCLUSION:</b></p><ul><li><b>VIP Wildlife Encounter – guaranteed hands-on experience<br> with koalas, crocodile, snakes<br> and more , delivered by licensed wildlife educators<br> Morning Tea&nbsp;</b><b>-Amazing tasty treats at Akuna Anglesea&nbsp;</b></li></ul><ul><li><b>&nbsp;Great Ocean Road Sightseeing&nbsp;</b><b>Iconic stops including Memorial<br> Arch, Apollo Bay, and the Twelve Apostles</b></li></ul><ul><li><b>&nbsp;Comfortable Transport&nbsp;</b><b>-Modern coach with air-conditioning and<br> professional driver&nbsp;</b></li></ul><ul><li><b>&nbsp;Small Group Experience&nbsp;</b><b>-capped daily numbers for comfort and<br> personal interaction&nbsp;</b></li></ul><ul><li><b>&nbsp;Professional Host/Guide – to ensure a smooth and enjoyable day</b></li></ul><p><br></p><p></p><p></p><h3><strong>停靠点 1：澳大利亚野生动物保证互动体验 – 仅此一家</strong></h3><br><p><b>您的一天从别具一格的体验开始——这是大洋路上其他任何旅行团都无法提供的：</b><br><br><b>一次有保证的、可亲手接触的真实澳大利亚野生动物互动。</b><br><br><b>您将在持证指导员的监督下，亲自抚摸并与考拉合影。</b></p><br><p><b>其他旅行团也许承诺“有机会看到野生动物”，</b><br><br><b>但我们能 保证 您一定见到。</b><br><br><b>无需远远观望或碰运气——</b><br><br><b>在安格尔西 Akuna 的私人室内场地中，</b><br><br><b>由 WildlifeXposure 持证的野生动物教育员带您进行</b><br><br><b>安全、舒适、近距离的互动体验。</b></p><p><b>您将亲自接触到：</b></p><ul><li><p><strong>考拉 – 抚摸并合影（持证监督）</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>蛇、鳄鱼和澳洲本土鸟类</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>负鼠、滑翔鼠、蜥蜴和巨蜥等爬行动物</strong></p></li></ul><p><b>这一难忘的 VIP 野生动物体验</b><br><br><b>还包含 Akuna 获奖餐厅的 早茶时光 ——</b><br><br><b>新鲜咖啡、酥点、三明治和果汁。</b><br><br><b>之后我们将正式踏上大洋路之旅。</b></p><h3><strong><br></strong></h3><h3><strong>停靠点 2：大洋路纪念拱门</strong></h3><br><p><b>接下来，我们将前往著名的 纪念拱门，</b><br><br><b>这座历史性的地标由一战退伍军人修建，</b><br><br><b>是世界上最大的战争纪念碑。</b><br><br><b>这是拍照留念的绝佳地点——</b><br><br><b>也是您海岸探险之旅真正的起点。</b></p><br><br><h3><strong>停靠点 3：阿波罗湾 – 海边午餐</strong></h3><br><p><b>在迷人的海滨小镇 阿波罗湾 放松休息，</b><br><br><b>这里是奥特韦山脉与大海交汇的地方。</b><br><br><b>您可自由享用午餐、漫步沙滩，</b><br><br><b>或探索当地商店后继续西行。</b></p><br><br><h3><strong>停靠点 4：十二使徒岩 – 海岸地标</strong></h3><br><p><b>我们的最后一站是令人叹为观止的 十二使徒岩 ——</b><br><br><b>维多利亚州最具代表性的自然奇观。</b><br><br><b>您可沿着观景步道漫步，</b><br><br><b>欣赏壮丽的悬崖与海上岩柱，</b><br><br><b>拍摄一生难忘的照片。</b></p><br><br><h3><strong>返程旅途</strong></h3><br><p><b>回程将穿越奥特韦森林与乡村风光，</b><br><br><b>为您的一日探险画上宁静完美的句号。</b></p><br><br><p><b>没有任何其他旅行能做到这一点 ——</b><br><br><strong>保证亲手接触考拉，</strong><br><br><b>再加上大洋路最精彩的景点，</b><br><br><b>一切尽在一天之内完成！</b></p><br><br><h3><strong>行程包含内容：</strong></h3><br><p><strong>VIP 野生动物互动体验 –</strong><br><br><b>保证与考拉、鳄鱼、蛇等近距离接触，</b><br><br><b>由持证野生动物教育员带领。</b></p><br><p><strong>早茶时光 –</strong><br><br><b>在安格尔西 Akuna 餐厅享用美味点心。</b></p><br><p><strong>大洋路观光 –</strong><br><br><b>包含纪念拱门、阿波罗湾及十二使徒岩等标志性景点。</b></p><br><p><strong>舒适交通 –</strong><br><br><b>现代空调旅游大巴，配专业司机。</b></p><br><p><strong>小团体体验 –</strong><br><br><b>每日人数限制，保证舒适与个性化互动。</b></p><br><p><strong>专业导游/主持人 –</strong><br><br><b>确保行程顺畅愉快。</b></p>",
